          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lobo-nono rik obedo lobo luŋ ame ocakere i Areor ame tye i ŋet luŋ me Arnon, tuno kede i kidi me Cirion (ame en Kermon), ",
          "type": "text",
